course: dictionary
lesson: 7601
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning. To pick the right one, read the sentence around the word. The clues will tell you which meaning the author means. «Isla predicts the princess will save herself instead of waiting for a prince.» The words story, waiting and prince tell you this princess is a royal girl in a tale.
explain: Princess has several meanings. It can mean the daughter or granddaughter of a king or queen. It can mean the wife of a prince. In fairy tales, it means a royal girl or young woman, often the hero of the story. Sometimes people use it in a teasing way for someone who acts spoiled.
explain: Always check your meaning by putting it into the sentence in place of the word. If it still makes sense, you have probably found the right meaning. If it does not, try another meaning from the list. Good readers do this without even thinking about it.
fact: Some words have more than one meaning.
fact: Context clues help you choose the right meaning.
fact: «Princess» means the daughter or granddaughter of a king or queen.
fact: «Princess» can also mean a royal girl or young woman in a fairy tale, often the heroine.
fact: «Princess» can be teasing, as in «Don't be such a princess», meaning someone who acts spoiled.
exercise: «Isla predicts the princess will save herself instead of waiting for a prince.» What is the princess in this story? | A cook who works in a kitchen | *A royal girl or young woman, often the heroine | A prince's brother | A horse that runs very fast
exercise: A boy complains about getting his shoes wet. His friend says, «Don't be such a princess.» What does it mean? | He is the daughter of a king | He is about to marry a prince | *He is acting spoiled and treating himself as very special | He is reading a fairy tale
exercise: Which word means the daughter or granddaughter of a king or queen? | Gardener | Wizard | *Princess | Dragon
test: «Isla predicts the princess will save herself.» Which clue tells you this is a story? | The word herself | *The word story and the idea of a rescue | The word predicts | The word will
test: What is the wife of a prince called? | *Princess | Nanny | Knight | Queen
exam: In «Don't be such a princess», which meaning of princess is used? | *Someone who acts spoiled and very special | The daughter of a king | A royal girl in a fairy tale | The wife of a prince
